 "title": "Centuries of federal debt",
 "hook": "The US Treasury’s “Debt to the Penny” dataset reports the total amount of outstanding public debt issued by the federal government — updated daily and going back to April 1, 1993. As of Monday, that number was $26,811,409,726,497.33. Another of the Treasury’s datasets provides annual debt figures going back to 1789.",
